1
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:10,680
As Saruman's evil is washed away,
we send a clear message to Mordor.

2
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:16,590
Men are not so weak yet that they are
powerless to resist the Dark Lord's will

3
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,480
entirely.

4
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:25,970
The ruin of Isengard will prove to be a
setback, but we would be fools to believe it

5
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,000
a deterrent.

6
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:33,420
Sauron's power grows by the day.

7
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:36,280
Soon he will be ready to strike.

8
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:40,740
Our only advantage now lies in his hubris.

9
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:47,080
We must force his hand and make him believe
that we will use the ring against him.

10
00:00:55,160 --> 00:01:00,760
tonight we remember those who gave
their blood to defend this country

11
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:04,100
hail the victorious dead

12
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:20,880
No news of Frodo.

13
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:22,920
No word.

14
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:24,340
Nothing.

15
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:29,620
What does your heart tell you?

16
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,240
That Frodo is alive.

17
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:42,840
Yes.

18
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:47,720
Yes, Mr. Lowe.

19
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,280
What are you doing?

20
00:02:05,740 --> 00:02:08,560
Pippin, are you mad?
I just want to look at it.

21
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:11,460
Just one more time. Put it back.

22
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:18,100
Pippin.

23
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:31,860
I see you. Pippin.
